      "text": "Hello, how are things going?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 7.67,
      "end": 14.13,
      "text": "The most common reason is opening the oven door too early. The cake hasn't set yet, and the cool air makes it collapse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 20.74,
      "end": 25.7,
      "text": "That might be it. Wait until at least three quarters of the baking time before you open the door."
    },
